ment27:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment27","raw_text":"红弃送三兵，佳着，可迫使黑中象高飞，有利于发挥中炮的作用，此系进攻前的准备。","text":"红弃送三兵，佳着，可迫使黑中象高飞，有利于发挥中炮的作用，此系进攻前的准备。","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":27,"anchor_node_id":"0:27","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment32:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment32","raw_text":"红平车妙手，可稳获中卒，由此红方控制全局。黑不得已兑车，如炮4进2，则炮五进三，红得车胜。","text":"红平车妙手，可稳获中卒，由此红方控制全局。黑不得已兑车，如炮4进2，则炮五进三，红得车胜。","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":32,"anchor_node_id":"0:32","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment41:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment41","raw_text":"红胜。||此时形势，红出帅是杀王妙手，下伏车三平四“铁门栓”绝杀。","text":"红胜。\n此时形势，红出帅是杀王妙手，下伏车三平四“铁门栓”绝杀。","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":41,"anchor_node_id":"0:41","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false}],"issues":[],"metadata":{"DhtmlXQ_init":["500,350"],"DhtmlXQ_title":["江苏徐天红 先胜 安徽张元启"],"DhtmlXQ_event":["第一章 中炮对屏风马类（56局）"],"DhtmlXQ_result":["未知"],"DhtmlXQ_open":["C73 五七炮互进三兵对屏风马边卒右马外盘河"],"DhtmlXQ_remark":[""],"DhtmlXQ_author":[""],"DhtmlXQ_binit":["0919293949596979891777062646668600102030405060708012720323436383"]},"source_tag_count":14,"identical_tag_duplicates":0,"binit":"0919293949596979891777062646668600102030405060708012720323436383","side_to_move":"w","side_basis":"color of first source mover at binit square","standard_start":true,"summary":{"lines":1,"structured_branches":0,"line_statuses":{"legal":1},"source_move_records":41,"legal_move_records":41,"annotations":5,"annotation_statuses":{"attached":5}},"memberships":[{"book_id":"yl-book-66","category_id":"66","title":"第一章 中炮对屏风马类 江苏徐天红 先胜 安徽张元启","catalogue_order":44,"directory_url":"https://m.xiangqiqipu.com/Category/List-66-2.html"}],"book_ids":["yl-book-66"]}}
